{"id":"d1583fe749649bad","group":"14","path":"14/14-ex-regular-action-torsor.md","title":"Example — 右群作用拓扑斯中的规范 torsor","display":"Example — 右群作用拓扑斯中的规范 torsor","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-ex-regular-action-torsor","aliases":["14-ex-regular-action-torsor"],"display":"Example — 右群作用拓扑斯中的规范 torsor","source_ref":"VIII.2, pp.427–428","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-algebraic-structures]]","[[14-df-right-group-actions]]","[[14-df-internal-group-and-torsor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-ex-regular-action-torsor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-ex-regular-action-torsor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Example — 右群作用拓扑斯中的规范 torsor"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"VIII.2, pp.427–428"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4d1aca1534bd822e\" href=\"?note=4d1aca1534bd822e\" title=\"14-df-algebraic-structures\">14-df-algebraic-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ff1dddefb4838916\" href=\"?note=ff1dddefb4838916\" title=\"14-df-right-group-actions\">14-df-right-group-actions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bce4e5bfeb4a50a7\" href=\"?note=bce4e5bfeb4a50a7\" title=\"14-df-internal-group-and-torsor\">14-df-internal-group-and-torsor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:G^2\\to G\">\\(\\mu:G^2\\to G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in G\">\\(e\\in G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:G\\to G\">\\(\\iota:G\\to G\\)</span>，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4d1aca1534bd822e\" href=\"?note=4d1aca1534bd822e\" title=\"14-df-algebraic-structures\">14-df-algebraic-structures</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\)</span>；记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gh=\\mu(g,h)\">\\(gh=\\mu(g,h)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^{-1}=\\iota(g)\">\\(g^{-1}=\\iota(g)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG,\\mathbf1_G,b_G\">\\(BG,\\mathbf1_G,b_G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ff1dddefb4838916\" href=\"?note=ff1dddefb4838916\" title=\"14-df-right-group-actions\">14-df-right-group-actions</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta G\">\\(\\Delta G\\)</span> 为底集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 取平凡作用的对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为底集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 取右正则作用的对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_\\Delta,\\rho_T,m_\\Delta,e_\\Delta,\\iota_\\Delta,\\rho,\\nu\">\\(\\rho_\\Delta,\\rho_T,m_\\Delta,e_\\Delta,\\iota_\\Delta,\\rho,\\nu\\)</span> 为下式构造，乘积均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG\">\\(BG\\)</span> 的所选对角作用积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_\\Delta(g,k)=g,\\qquad\\rho_T(h,k)=hk,\\qquad\\Delta G=(G,\\rho_\\Delta),\\qquad T=(G,\\rho_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_\\Delta(g,k)=g,\\qquad\\rho_T(h,k)=hk,\\qquad\\Delta G=(G,\\rho_\\Delta),\\qquad T=(G,\\rho_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m_\\Delta=(\\Delta G\\times\\Delta G,\\Delta G,((g,h)\\mapsto gh)),\\quad e_\\Delta=(\\mathbf1_G,\\Delta G,(*\\mapsto e)),\\quad\\iota_\\Delta=(\\Delta G,\\Delta G,(g\\mapsto g^{-1})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m_\\Delta=(\\Delta G\\times\\Delta G,\\Delta G,((g,h)\\mapsto gh)),\\quad e_\\Delta=(\\mathbf1_G,\\Delta G,(*\\mapsto e)),\\quad\\iota_\\Delta=(\\Delta G,\\Delta G,(g\\mapsto g^{-1})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(\\Delta G\\times T,T,((g,h)\\mapsto gh)),\\quad\\nu=(\\Delta G\\times T,T\\times T,((g,h)\\mapsto(gh,h))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho=(\\Delta G\\times T,T,((g,h)\\mapsto gh)),\\quad\\nu=(\\Delta G\\times T,T\\times T,((g,h)\\mapsto(gh,h))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu^{-1}=(T\\times T,\\Delta G\\times T,((a,b)\\mapsto(ab^{-1},b))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu^{-1}=(T\\times T,\\Delta G\\times T,((a,b)\\mapsto(ab^{-1},b))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsTorsor}_{BG}(T,\\rho;\\Delta G,m_\\Delta,e_\\Delta,\\iota_\\Delta),\\qquad\\bigl(\\exists s\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(\\mathbf1_G,T)\\bigr)\\Longleftrightarrow G=\\{e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsTorsor}_{BG}(T,\\rho;\\Delta G,m_\\Delta,e_\\Delta,\\iota_\\Delta),\\qquad\\bigl(\\exists s\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(\\mathbf1_G,T)\\bigr)\\Longleftrightarrow G=\\{e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>结构映射及 torsor 的比较同构现均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG\">\\(BG\\)</span> 的带标签箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu=\\langle\\rho,\\pi_T\\rangle\">\\(\\nu=\\langle\\rho,\\pi_T\\rangle\\)</span> 的等式由积的两投影验证。以下公式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_G\">\\(b_G\\)</span> 提取的底层函数计算。</p>\n<p>乘法等变是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(hk)=(gh)k\">\\(g(hk)=(gh)k\\)</span>，且左作用满足群律。上式逆映射也等变，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(ak)(bk)^{-1}=ab^{-1}\">\\((ak)(bk)^{-1}=ab^{-1}\\)</span>，第一分量的右作用平凡。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 非空，因此到终对象的底层映射满射，故为满态射。全局截面需要一个被所有右乘固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in G\">\\(h\\in G\\)</span>，迫使每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=e\">\\(g=e\\)</span>。该例清楚区分 torsor 的局部非空和全局有点，也是原书构造群 torsor 分类拓扑斯的规范对象。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，VIII.2, pp.427–428。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-algebraic-structures","status":"resolved","id":"4d1aca1534bd822e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-algebraic-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-right-group-actions","status":"resolved","id":"ff1dddefb4838916","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-right-group-actions]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-internal-group-and-torsor","status":"resolved","id":"bce4e5bfeb4a50a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-internal-group-and-torsor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-algebraic-structures","status":"resolved","id":"4d1aca1534bd822e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","